{"availability":"available","full":"coldsmirk/ledger","name":"ledger","description":"A Mantine-native DataTable built on TanStack Table and TanStack Virtual","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-17T03:58:36Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:41:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://coldsmirk.github.io/ledger/","topics":["data-grid","datatable","mantine","react","table","tanstack-table","typescript","virtualization"],"demo":"https://coldsmirk.github.io/ledger/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.548Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.548Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.548Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.548Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Mantine-native built on TanStack Table and TanStack Virtual.","Live demo: coldsmirk.github.io/ledger — one page per feature area, bilingual (EN / 简体中文), each with a view-source drawer.","Mantine deliberately ships no data grid; the community options either reimplement table logic from scratch or bury TanStack under a configuration bag. ledger takes a narrower stance: the behavior layer speaks TanStack's language, the presentation layer speaks Mantine's — raw ColumnDefs and verbatim state shapes on one side, forwarded Table style props, BoxProps sizing, and the Styles API on the other, rendered as a real that fills whatever space its parent gives it."],"features":["TanStack-verbatim behavior — columns are raw TanStack ColumnDefs (presentation concerns ride a typed meta extension); every state slice is independently controllable as x / defaultX / onXChange; behavior switches use…","Mantine-native presentation — forwarded Table style props (striped, highlightOnHover, withTableBorder, …), size on Mantine's five sizes, BoxProps sizing (h, mah, flex), Styles API theming, and dark mode / RTL inherited…","Sorting, filtering, and pagination — multi-sort, per-column filter variants with faceted options, global search, and a pagination bar; each with a documented server mode.","Rows — selection (multi/single, shift ranges, selection bar), master–detail expansion, tree data, grouping with aggregation, row pinning, and drag or keyboard row reordering.","Columns — pinning, resizing, drag reordering, visibility with a ready-made columns panel, and header groups."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/coldsmirk/ledger/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6def662372dd049ab871d146a1af7686432114dc4420d4d6ddd0491eaceb6f32","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.947Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.947Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Mantine-native built on TanStack Table and TanStack Virtual.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/coldsmirk/ledger/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6def662372dd049ab871d146a1af7686432114dc4420d4d6ddd0491eaceb6f32","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/coldsmirk/ledger/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.947Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T03:41:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/coldsmirk/ledger/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:14.948Z","hash":"6def662372dd049ab871d146a1af7686432114dc4420d4d6ddd0491eaceb6f32","originalBytes":7550,"storedBytes":7550,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pnpm","docs","mantine","tanstack","table","coldsmirk","check","columns","every","ledger-mantine","api","import","state","header","hook","ledger","lint","mode","package","pagination","pinning","sizing","string","age","architecture.md","behavior","commits","components","compound","createcolumnhelper","dates","defaults","design.md","each","editing","email","feature","full","helper.accessor","install","license","meta","name","one","presentation","real","row","selection","size","sorting","styles.css","sugar","test","usedatatable","virtualization","accessibility","add","app-wide","bar","ba